                "seriesInformation": {
                  "typeName": "seriesInformation",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This is part of a larger survey that started in 2021. The first survey was conducted in 2021 and the current dataset is a result of a follow-up survey conducted in 2023. The dataset contains most of the measures in the 2021 survey, with the addition of other relevant measures, such as collective efficacy, collective action and flood impacts perceived by participants."
